{title: Sano Sapana}
{alternate_title: सानो सपना}
{artist: Guitar Chords Demo}
{language: Nepali}
{key: G}
{capo: 0}
{difficulty: beginner}
{strumming: D DU UDU}
{rights: original}
{rights_notes: Original demonstration lyrics and chord progression.}

{start_of_verse}
[G]Sano sapana [D]mutuma bokera
[Em]Hidchhu ma aaja [C]bato rojera
[G]Bihana ko gham [D]muskurauchha
[C]Naya yo dinle [G]malai bolauchha
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[G]Bistarai bistarai [D]agadi badhaun
[Em]Aafnai dhunma [C]geet gauna thalaun
{end_of_chorus}